+    <p><strong>Privacy by design</strong></p>
+    <p>We collect as little personal data as possible. By default, no optional third-party scripts are loaded, no advertising or cross-site tracking is used, and fonts are served from our own servers so your IP address is not shared with a font provider.</p>
