+
+    <p><strong>Account (sign-in and sign-up)</strong></p>
+    <p>To create an account we ask only for a username and a password; no email address or real name is required, and we recommend choosing a pseudonym. These details are sent over an encrypted connection to our account service hosted on Google Cloud (region us-central1, USA) and are used solely to create and authenticate your account. Credential requests are sent without cookies or referrer information, and pages containing these forms are never cached. Legal basis: performance of a contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR). You may request deletion of your account at any time.</p>
